uid": "da_t3aoce", "has_records": true, "features": ["analyze", "geo", "timeserie"], "attachments": [], "alternative_exports": [], "data_visible": true, "metas": {"default": {"title": "World Heritage List", "title_en": "World Heritage List", "title_fr": "Liste du Patrimoine mondial ", "title_es": "Lista del Patrimonio Mundial", "title_ar": "\u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a", "description": "This dataset contains the UNESCO World Heritage List, showcasing sites of outstanding universal value recognized for their cultural, natural, or mixed significance. It includes information on site locations, criteria for inclusion, and the year of inscription, supporting efforts to safeguard the world\u2019s heritage for future generations.<pre class=\"\"><a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/syndication\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and Conditions of Use</a></pre><br>", "description_en": "This dataset contains the UNESCO World Heritage List, showcasing sites of outstanding universal value recognized for their cultural, natural, or mixed significance. It includes information on site locations, criteria for inclusion, and the year of inscription, supporting efforts to safeguard the world\u2019s heritage for future generations.<pre class=\"\"><a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/syndication\" target=\"_blank\">Terms and Conditions of Use</a></pre><br>", "description_fr": "Ce jeu de donn\u00e9es contient la liste du patrimoine mondial de l'UNESCO, qui pr\u00e9sente les sites d'une valeur universelle exceptionnelle reconnus pour leur importance culturelle, naturelle ou mixte. Il comprend des informations sur l'emplacement des sites, les crit\u00e8res d'inscription et l'ann\u00e9e d'inscription, soutenant ainsi les efforts de sauvegarde du patrimoine mondial pour les g\u00e9n\u00e9rations futures.<pre class=\"\"><a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/fr/syndication\" target=\"_blank\">Conditions d'utilisation</a></pre><br>", "description_es": "Este conjunto de datos contiene la Lista del Patrimonio Mundial de la UNESCO, que muestra los sitios de valor universal excepcional reconocidos por su importancia cultural, natural o mixta. Incluye informaci\u00f3n sobre la ubicaci\u00f3n de los sitios, los criterios de inclusi\u00f3n y el a\u00f1o de inscripci\u00f3n, apoyando los esfuerzos para salvaguardar el patrimonio mundial para las generaciones futuras.<pre class=\"\"><a href=\"https://whc.unesco.org/en/syndication\" target=\"_blank\">Condiciones de uso</a></pre><br>", "description_ar": "\u062a\u062d\u062a\u0648\u064a \u0645\u062c\u0645\u0648\u0639\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u064a\u0627\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0642\u0627\u0626\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u064a\u0648\u0646\u0633\u0643\u0648 \u0644\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u062a\u0639\u0631\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0630\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0642\u064a\u0645\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0627\u0631\u0632\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0639\u062a\u0631\u0641 \u0628\u0647\u0627 \u0644\u0623\u0647\u0645\u064a\u062a\u0647\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u062b\u0642\u0627\u0641\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0637\u0628\u064a\u0639\u064a\u0629 \u0623\u0648 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u062a\u0644\u0637\u0629. \u0648\u062a\u062a\u0636\u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0639\u0644\u0648\u0645\u0627\u062a \u0639\u0646 \u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0627\u0642\u0639\u060c \u0648\u0645\u0639\u0627\u064a\u064a\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062c\u060c \u0648\u0633\u0646\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062c\u060c \u0645\u0645\u0627 \u064a\u062f\u0639\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u062c\u0647\u0648\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0628\u0630\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u0644\u062d\u0645\u0627\u064a\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u0631\u0627\u062b \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645\u06